    "document": "Event Companion",
    "section": "Event Companion",
    "summary": "Organisers can use the terrain layouts from Games Workshop events with the current Chapter Approved Mission Deck. The Warhammer Studio designed them to create trade-offs tied to each mission’s objectives. Each Primary Mission has three recommended layouts named A, B and C. The organiser can specify which layout to use, or the players can determine it at random.",
